(slower-hummingbird-sv05-hover-validation-6dof)
*title Hummingbird ten-second source-frame hover validation
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle aero-load-mode=direct-wrench aero-wrench-frame=source-z-up reference-area=1.0 reference-length=0.34 dry-mass-kg=0.5 inertia-x=0.00365 inertia-y=0.00368 inertia-z=0.00703 envelope-max-speed=10
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=1 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=720
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*runtime control rotor-speed vehicle=1 default=468.7244338633868 lower=0 upper=1500
*trajectory 1 hummingbird start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6378139.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.0 ydt=0.0 zdt=0.0 qw=0.5 qx=-0.5 qy=-0.5 qz=0.5 time=0.0 mass=0.5 propellant_mass=0.0
  *segment 1 hover
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.005
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *when time>10.0 stop
*end
